    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Acquisition monitor",
      "type": "text",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Phase 1 · Source viability\nRead-only view of FBS demo history acquisition. Completed requests and stored raw ticks measure retrieval. Raw data includes empty sessions and quote anomalies; use the diagnostic counts below to inspect them.\n\nResearch eligibility requires a dated, immutable dataset selection and the [data acceptance evidence](/d/tradebot-data-quality). Retrieval completion alone does not establish eligibility."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Runner",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Operating-system observation. Stage is not reported: unchanged checkpoint counts may reflect resume verification. Checkpoint age alone cannot establish a stalled process.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "tradebot-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Stopped · incomplete",
                  "color": "orange"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Running",
                  "color": "blue"
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "Retrieval complete",
                  "color": "blue"
                },
                "-1": {
                  "text": "Activity unknown",
                  "color": "gray"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "",
          "noValue": "No observation"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "tradebot_acquisition_run_state",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
