      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Using this data:** raw files are retained as diagnostic evidence. A research-eligible dataset must identify its exact source hashes, selected partitions, exclusions and applicable acceptance records. Do not infer eligibility from the retrieved percentage, zero invalid checkpoints or byte-identical repeats.\n\nCrossed quotes are structural defects. Locked quotes and repeated quotes remain separately reported observations. Empty sessions need dated liquidity-calendar or broker evidence. No metric here counts accepted research rows.\n\nCurrent-value panels query the latest exporter snapshot; only the corpus-history chart uses time-range history. Raw hashes are checked by the acquisition/validation workflow, not rescanned by this monitor."
      },
